  "email": "priya.nair@brightline.example",
  "reason": "Ticket sender reports office-wide internet outage; checking account, devices, and VPN access per KB-014 and KB-016."
}

{
  "hostname": "BL-LT-0103",
  "reason": "Per KB-014 quick check: determine whether the sender's laptop has an internet path during the reported office outage."
}

{
  "summary": "P1: Office-wide internet outage reported by Priya Nair (IT Manager, user_id 3). Entire floor reports no internet and cannot work. Checked: account is active, not blocked, VPN access true, no failed logins. Her laptop BL-LT-0103 shows online with a recent check-in (2026-10-11 03:04 UTC) and no warnings, so the laptop is not the isolated cause; the problem looks office-wide. Per KB-014, the office network being down for several people is an escalation trigger. Not yet checked: office network/ISP/firewall status and printer state. Needs Tier 2 to investigate the office network or ISP link urgently.",
  "reason": "Office network outage affecting multiple users (P1) meets KB-014 escalation criteria; Tier 1 tools cannot diagnose the office network."
}

{
  "outcome": "escalated",
  "reply_to_user": "Thanks for reporting this. Because the outage is affecting the whole office, I've escalated it as a priority to our Tier 2 network team, who can investigate the office network directly. Your own laptop checks as online on our side, so the problem appears to be with the shared office connection rather than your device. Please let the floor know the issue is being worked on. If you can, note the time it started and whether any wired connections are also down, as that will help the engineer.",
  "internal_note": "P1 office-wide internet outage reported by Priya Nair (user_id 3, IT Manager). Account active, not blocked, VPN access true, 0 failed logins. Laptop BL-LT-0103 shows online, last check-in 2026-10-11 03:04 UTC, no warnings, so the device is not isolated. Per KB-014, multiple users affected meets the escalation criteria. Escalated to Tier 2 (escalation_id 1). Not yet checked: office network/ISP/firewall status and printers (KB-022 printer checks apply if printing is also failing). No fixes were attempted or queued.",
  "kb_articles": [
    "KB-014"
  ],
  "confidence": "high"
}
